"toolu_01SzpRCzgvnGzTf2cbTzy7Em":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162033__x07393c/work/FarPry2*/ && W=250 tools/api.sh applySky skyAt groundFog glowMaterial MeshBasicNodeMaterial SkyState | head -60; grep -n \"MeshBasicNodeMaterial\" API.md | head -3; node -e '\nimport(\"./pixel-engine.js\").then(m=>{console.log(Object.keys(m).length, [\"THREE\",\"TSL\",\"PALETTE\",\"applySky\",\"skyAt\",\"groundFog\",\"Terrain\",\"GrassField\",\"CharacterController\",\"SpriteBatch\",\"textureDef\",\"spriteSheet\",\"Vehicle\",\"NavGrid\",\"BehaviorTree\",\"Timeline\",\"Ragdoll\",\"renderSound\",\"model\",\"buildModel\",\"checkModel\",\"compileClips\",\"Boids\",\"Precipitation\",\"WindUniforms\",\"swayObject\",\"clothGrid\",\"SoftMesh\",\"Decals\",\"Trail\",\"Squash\",\"HERO_RAGDOLL\",\"HERO_RIG\",\"HERO_CLIPS\",\"gaitClip\",\"spatialize\",\"glowMaterial\",\"analyzeClip\",\"validateClip\",\"twoBoneIK\",\"MODEL_LIBRARY\",\"addModelColliders\",\"Song\",\"parseSong\",\"validateTexture\",\"textureMap\",\"toonMaterial\",\"mergeStaticMeshes\",\"bt\"].map(k=>k+\":\"+(k in m)).join(\" \"))})'"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SzpRCzgvnGzTf2cbTzy7Em","type":"tool_result","content":"### applySky()\n\n```ts\nfunction applySky(engine: Pick<Engine, 'sun' | 'ambient' | 'scene' | 'setSunDirection'>, s: SkyState): void\n```\n\nPut a sky on the engine: sun direction, colour and strength, ambient light, background.\n\n### skyAt()\n\n```ts\nfunction skyAt(hour: number): SkyState\n```\n\nThe sky at `hour` (wraps around 24).\n\n### groundFog()\n\n```ts\nfunction groundFog(o: { color?: number; top?: number; amount?: number; near?: number; far?: number } = {}): { node: Node; color: UniformNode<\"color\", Color>; amount: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; top: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; }\n```\n\nFog for `scene.fogNode` with live settings (uniforms: changing them never recompiles):\nground mist that thickens below `top` (m) and a haze that grows with distance from the\ncamera, both up to `amount` (0..1), in `color` (match the sky).\n\n  const mist = groundFog({ color: s.sky, top: 1.5 });\n  (scene as { fogNode: unknown }).fogNode = mist.node;\n  mist.amount.value = 0.8; mist.color.value.setHex(s.sky);\n\n### glowMaterial()\n\n```ts\nfunction glowMaterial(color: ColorRepresentation): MeshBasicNodeMaterial\n```\n\nUnlit, full-bright material for a colour (flames, eyes, screens, crystal cores), shared and\ncached per colour like `toonMaterial` (`userData.shared`; disposing it drops it from the\ncache). Its vertices snap with the toon materials' under the `ps1` filter, so a glowing part\nstays on its model.\n\n### interface SkyState\n\n- `readonly sunDir: [number, number, number]`: Unit vector toward the sun (or the moon, at night).\n- `readonly sunColor: number`\n- `readonly sunIntensity: number`\n- `readonly ambientColor: number`\n- `readonly ambientIntensity: number`\n- `readonly sky: number`: Background (sky) and fog colour.\n- `readonly night: number`: 0 by day, 1 deep at night: lanterns, stars, windows.\n\n1195:function glowMaterial(color: ColorRepresentation): MeshBasicNodeMaterial\n3903:`three/webgpu` (three.js r186: Mesh, Group, Vector3, BoxGeometry, MeshBasicNodeMaterial, ...). Use `THREE.X` for anything three.js has; never import a second copy of three (two copies break `instanceof` and the renderer).\n4266:function forceFieldMaterial(o: ShaderOptions = {}): MeshBasicNodeMaterial\n282 THREE:true TSL:true PALETTE:true applySky:true skyAt:true groundFog:true Terrain:true GrassField:true CharacterController:true SpriteBatch:true textureDef:true spriteSheet:true Vehicle:true NavGrid:true BehaviorTree:true Timeline:true Ragdoll:true renderSound:true model:true buildModel:true checkModel:true compileClips:true Boids:true Precipitation:true WindUniforms:true swayObject:true clothGrid:true SoftMesh:true Decals:true Trail:true Squash:true HERO_RAGDOLL:true HERO_RIG:true HERO_CLIPS:true gaitClip:true spatialize:true glowMaterial:true analyzeClip:true validateClip:true twoBoneIK:true MODEL_LIBRARY:true addModelColliders:true Song:false parseSong:true validateTexture:true textureMap:true toonMaterial:true mergeStaticMeshes:true bt:true","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"feff64bd-df6d-45b2-b337-83604d3a2d73","uuid":"fdd003c8-89f2-4d56-b6e3-760eb4004fa2","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:25:47.695Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### applySky()\n\n```ts\nfunction applySky(engine: Pick<Engine, 'sun' | 'ambient' | 'scene' | 'setSunDirection'>, s: SkyState): void\n```\n\nPut a sky on the engine: sun direction, colour and strength, ambient light, background.\n\n### skyAt()\n\n```ts\nfunction skyAt(hour: number): SkyState\n```\n\nThe sky at `hour` (wraps around 24).\n\n### groundFog()\n\n```ts\nfunction groundFog(o: { color?: number; top?: number; amount?: number; near?: number; far?: number } = {}): { node: Node; color: UniformNode<\"color\", Color>; amount: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; top: UniformNode<\"float\", number>; }\n```\n\nFog for `scene.fogNode` with live settings (uniforms: changing them never recompiles):\nground mist that thickens below `top` (m) and a haze that grows with distance from the\ncamera, both up to `amount` (0..1), in `color` (match the sky).\n\n  const mist = groundFog({ color: s.sky, top: 1.5 });\n  (scene as { fogNode: unknown }).fogNode = mist.node;\n  mist.amount.value = 0.8; mist.color.value.setHex(s.sky);\n\n### glowMaterial()\n\n```ts\nfunction glowMaterial(color: ColorRepresentation): MeshBasicNodeMaterial\n```\n\nUnlit, full-bright material for a colour (flames, eyes, screens, crystal cores), shared and\ncached per colour like `toonMaterial` (`userData.shared`; disposing it drops it from the\ncache). Its vertices snap with the toon materials' under the `ps1` filter, so a glowing part\nstays on its model.\n\n### interface SkyState\n\n- `readonly sunDir: [number, number, number]`: Unit vector toward the sun (or the moon, at night).\n- `readonly sunColor: number`\n- `readonly sunIntensity: number`\n- `readonly ambientColor: number`\n- `readonly ambientIntensity: number`\n- `readonly sky: number`: Background (sky) and fog colour.\n- `readonly night: number`: 0 by day, 1 deep at night: lanterns, stars, windows.\n\n1195:function glowMaterial(color: ColorRepresentation): MeshBasicNodeMaterial\n3903:`three/webgpu` (three.js r186: Mesh, Group, Vector3, BoxGeometry, MeshBasicNodeMaterial, ...). Use `THREE.X` for anything three.js has; never import a second copy of three (two copies break `instanceof` and the renderer).\n4266:function forceFieldMaterial(o: ShaderOptions = {}): MeshBasicNodeMaterial\n282 THREE:true TSL:true PALETTE:true applySky:true skyAt:true groundFog:true Terrain:true GrassField:true CharacterController:true SpriteBatch:true textureDef:true spriteSheet:true Vehicle:true NavGrid:true BehaviorTree:true Timeline:true Ragdoll:true renderSound:true model:true buildModel:true checkModel:true compileClips:true Boids:true Precipitation:true WindUniforms:true swayObject:true clothGrid:true SoftMesh:true Decals:true Trail:true Squash:true HERO_RAGDOLL:true HERO_RIG:true HERO_CLIPS:true gaitClip:true spatialize:true glowMaterial:true analyzeClip:true validateClip:true twoBoneIK:true MODEL_LIBRARY:true addModelColliders:true Song:false parseSong:true validateTexture:true textureMap:true toonMaterial:true mergeStaticMeshes:true bt:true","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SzpRCzgvnGzTf2cbTzy7Em","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
