dings, river water, rail) 2 weapons+viewmodel+wear/jam 3 soldiers AI 4 fire grid 5 body (hp/syrette/fever/surgery) 6 UI shell (hud, menus, glyphs, settings, map) 7 vehicles 8 missions+buddies 9 audio (sfx/music/voices) 10 round(Cash Run)+solo bots 11 dev mode + attract 12 tests(static,systems,playthrough,replay,browser,link?) + about + exit interview.\nCut candidates (sec 26 order): fauna, link, own hub card (already using hub card: card:false), chase cam, dust weather, extra mercy runs, M5, M4, M8.\nEOF\ncd FarPry2*/ && cat > tests/ISSUES.md <<'EOF'\n# Issues testing caught (one line each; CRITICAL = game breaking)\n- Engine loaded as CommonJS in Node because package.json lacked \"type\":\"module\" (CRITICAL, tests could not start).\n- Headless default camera is not 'first'; yaw was NaN and the player could not move until boot() passed camera preset 'first'.\n- Hub: shared-world traffic checks failed until the `me`/`s` message loop existed (all four scenarios, CRITICAL for hub).\nEOF\necho saved"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1490,"cache_read_input_tokens":194122,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1490},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"feff64bd-df6d-45b2-b337-83604d3a2d73","uuid":"3acbd1f2-2eed-4dea-9539-8c1986600f94","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:29:50.398Z","request_id":"req_011CgkegUwBBTLYdggCMXk2X","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01AUfJj5ofcnMWp77JPLPK6a":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162033__x07393c/work && cat > PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n# PROGRESS (read this first after a context compaction)\n- Root (work/) holds STAGE.md PLAN.md TASK.md PROGRESS.md. Dev folder D = work/FarPr