{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkej9Qkn8YGT1gTRmJ5r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TULHMDouwvZPF2NbDBStSU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162033__x07393c/work/FarPry2*/ && W=500 tools/api.sh RigSpec Key Pose JointPose Ease Layer | head -60; node -e '\nimport(\"./pixel-engine.js\").then(m=>{console.log(JSON.stringify(m.HERO_RIG).slice(0,900)); console.log(m.HERO_CLIPS.map(c=>c.name+\":\"+c.frames).join(\" \"))})'"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2016,"cache_read_input_tokens":198864,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2016},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"feff64bd-df6d-45b2-b337-83604d3a2d73","uuid":"5b7eb817-4a7f-4b68-95c2-dd46602b4576","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:30:13.162Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkej99d9orNVQvc59zSD","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01TULHMDouwvZPF2NbDBStSU":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162033__x07393c/work/FarPry2*/ && W=500 tools/api.sh RigSpec Key Pose JointPose Ease Layer | head -60; node -e '\nimport(\"./pixel-engine.js\").then(m=>{console.log(JSON.stringify(m.HERO_RIG).slice(0,900)); console.log(m.HERO_CLIPS.map(c=>c.name+\":\"+c.frames).join(\" \"))})'"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TULHMDouwvZPF2NbDBStSU","type":"tool_result","content":"### interface RigSpec\n\nEverything the tools need to know about a rig beyond its hierarchy.\n\n- `joints: readonly string[]`: Joint names in hierarchy order (root first).\n- `root: string`\n- `mirror: Readonly<Record<string, string>>`: Left/right counterparts for mirroring.\n- `soles: readonly string[]`: Mesh names that touch the ground (soles).\n- `trace: readonly string[]`: Points to trace in contact sheets (joint or mesh names).\n- `limits: Readonly<Record<string, JointLimit>>`: Human-plausible rotation ranges, degrees.\n- `fps: number`: Frame rate of the authoring format.\n- `legs?: LegRig`: Leg geometry, enabling foot IK and the gait generator.\n- `spine?: { torso?: string; head?: string; cap?: string }`: Joints the runtime procedural layers turn (PoseLayers): the torso and head look where the character is going; `cap` is an optional springy joint (not animated by clips).\n\n### type Key\n\n```ts\ntype Key = readonly [number, Pose, Ease?]\n```\n\n`[frame, pose, easeToNextKey?]`\n\n### type Pose\n\n```ts\ntype Pose = Readonly<Record<string, Euler | JointPose>>\n```\n\nJoint name → rotation (degrees) or full joint pose. Missing joints are at rest.\n\n### type Ease\n\n```ts\ntype Ease = EaseName | ((u: number) => number)\n```\n\n{\"fps\":30,\"root\":\"Pelvis\",\"joints\":[\"Pelvis\",\"Torso\",\"Head\",\"ArmR\",\"ForearmR\",\"HandR\",\"ArmL\",\"ForearmL\",\"HandL\",\"LegR\",\"ShinR\",\"FootR\",\"LegL\",\"ShinL\",\"FootL\"],\"mirror\":{\"ArmR\":\"ArmL\",\"ArmL\":\"ArmR\",\"ForearmR\":\"ForearmL\",\"ForearmL\":\"ForearmR\",\"HandR\":\"HandL\",\"HandL\":\"HandR\",\"LegR\":\"LegL\",\"LegL\":\"LegR\",\"ShinR\":\"ShinL\",\"ShinL\":\"ShinR\",\"FootR\":\"FootL\",\"FootL\":\"FootR\"},\"soles\":[\"ShoeR\",\"ShoeL\"],\"trace\":[\"GloveR\",\"GloveL\",\"ShoeR\",\"ShoeL\",\"Head\"],\"limits\":{\"ShinR\":{\"x\":[-3,165]},\"ShinL\":{\"x\":[-3,165]},\"ForearmR\":{\"x\":[-160,5]},\"ForearmL\":{\"x\":[-160,5]},\"Head\":{\"x\":[-60,70],\"y\":[-95,95],\"z\":[-45,45]},\"FootR\":{\"x\":[-80,80]},\"FootL\":{\"x\":[-80,80]},\"HandR\":{\"x\":[-90,70]},\"HandL\":{\"x\":[-90,70]},\"Torso\":{\"x\":[-50,90],\"y\":[-70,70],\"z\":[-45,45]}},\"legs\":{\"R\":{\"upper\":\"LegR\",\"lower\":\"ShinR\",\"foot\":\"FootR\",\"hip\":[-0.14,0,0]},\"L\":{\"upper\":\"LegL\",\"lower\":\"ShinL\",\"foot\":\"FootL\",\"hip\":[0.14,0,0]},\"rootHeight\"\nIdle:60 IdleLook:102 Teeter:30 Tiptoe:18 Walk:12 Run:12 Skid:18 SkidTurn:12 StepUp:8 StepDown:8 Crouch:40 CrouchWalk:12 CrouchSlide:20 ProneDown:16 Prone:60 Crawl:36 GetUpFront:21 Sit:60 SitDown:16 StandUp:16 LieDown:30 LieIdle:60 Sleep:90 GetUp:24 Jump:20 JumpUp:20 DoubleJump:22 TripleJump:30 Backflip:30 SideFlip:26 LongJump:36 WallKick:20 WallSlide:20 Fall:16 Dive:12 BellySlide:20 GroundPoundSpin:9 GroundPound:10 GroundPoundLand:15 Land:10 HardLand:30 Slide:20 Hang:40 ShimmyRight:20 ShimmyLeft:20 PullUp:27 ClimbIdle:40 Climb:24 Push:30 PushIdle:40 Grab:40 Pull:30 Punch:10 Punch2:10 Kick:14 SweepKick:18 JumpKick:14 Wave:44 Victory:48 Hurt:20 Slash1:12 Slash2:12 Slash3:18 Slam:24 LeapSlam:28 Spin:12 Cast:16 CastBig:22 CastWeapon:16 CastBigWeapon:22 BowDraw:18 BowRelease:12 Roll:14 Charge:14 Shout:20 HitReact:10 Death:36 Triumph:40","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"feff64bd-df6d-45b2-b337-83604d3a2d73","uuid":"feed8403-cf2a-4f64-9889-3e167011fc2b","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:30:13.300Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### interface RigSpec\n\nEverything the tools need to know about a rig beyond its hierarchy.\n\n- `joints: readonly string[]`: Joint names in hierarchy order (root first).\n- `root: string`\n- `mirror: Readonly<Record<string, string>>`: Left/right counterparts for mirroring.\n- `soles: readonly string[]`: Mesh names that touch the ground (soles).\n- `trace: readonly string[]`: Points to trace in contact sheets (joint or mesh names).\n- `limits: Readonly<Record<string, JointLimit>>`: Human-plausible rotation ranges, degrees.\n- `fps: number`: Frame rate of the authoring format.\n- `legs?: LegRig`: Leg geometry, enabling foot IK and the gait generator.\n- `spine?: { torso?: string; head?: string; cap?: string }`: Joints the runtime procedural layers turn (PoseLayers): the torso and head look where the character is going; `cap` is an optional springy joint (not animated by clips).\n\n### type Key\n\n```ts\ntype Key = readonly [number, Pose, Ease?]\n```\n\n`[frame, pose, easeToNextKey?]`\n\n### type Pose\n\n```ts\ntype Pose = Readonly<Record<string, Euler | JointPose>>\n```\n\nJoint name → rotation (degrees) or full joint pose. Missing joints are at rest.\n\n### type Ease\n\n```ts\ntype Ease = EaseName | ((u: number) => number)\n```\n\n{\"fps\":30,\"root\":\"Pelvis\",\"joints\":[\"Pelvis\",\"Torso\",\"Head\",\"ArmR\",\"ForearmR\",\"HandR\",\"ArmL\",\"ForearmL\",\"HandL\",\"LegR\",\"ShinR\",\"FootR\",\"LegL\",\"ShinL\",\"FootL\"],\"mirror\":{\"ArmR\":\"ArmL\",\"ArmL\":\"ArmR\",\"ForearmR\":\"ForearmL\",\"ForearmL\":\"ForearmR\",\"HandR\":\"HandL\",\"HandL\":\"HandR\",\"LegR\":\"LegL\",\"LegL\":\"LegR\",\"ShinR\":\"ShinL\",\"ShinL\":\"ShinR\",\"FootR\":\"FootL\",\"FootL\":\"FootR\"},\"soles\":[\"ShoeR\",\"ShoeL\"],\"trace\":[\"GloveR\",\"GloveL\",\"ShoeR\",\"ShoeL\",\"Head\"],\"limits\":{\"ShinR\":{\"x\":[-3,165]},\"ShinL\":{\"x\":[-3,165]},\"ForearmR\":{\"x\":[-160,5]},\"ForearmL\":{\"x\":[-160,5]},\"Head\":{\"x\":[-60,70],\"y\":[-95,95],\"z\":[-45,45]},\"FootR\":{\"x\":[-80,80]},\"FootL\":{\"x\":[-80,80]},\"HandR\":{\"x\":[-90,70]},\"HandL\":{\"x\":[-90,70]},\"Torso\":{\"x\":[-50,90],\"y\":[-70,70],\"z\":[-45,45]}},\"legs\":{\"R\":{\"upper\":\"LegR\",\"lower\":\"ShinR\",\"foot\":\"FootR\",\"hip\":[-0.14,0,0]},\"L\":{\"upper\":\"LegL\",\"lower\":\"ShinL\",\"foot\":\"FootL\",\"hip\":[0.14,0,0]},\"rootHeight\"\nIdle:60 IdleLook:102 Teeter:30 Tiptoe:18 Walk:12 Run:12 Skid:18 SkidTurn:12 StepUp:8 StepDown:8 Crouch:40 CrouchWalk:12 CrouchSlide:20 ProneDown:16 Prone:60 Crawl:36 GetUpFront:21 Sit:60 SitDown:16 StandUp:16 LieDown:30 LieIdle:60 Sleep:90 GetUp:24 Jump:20 JumpUp:20 DoubleJump:22 TripleJump:30 Backflip:30 SideFlip:26 LongJump:36 WallKick:20 WallSlide:20 Fall:16 Dive:12 BellySlide:20 GroundPoundSpin:9 GroundPound:10 GroundPoundLand:15 Land:10 HardLand:30 Slide:20 Hang:40 ShimmyRight:20 ShimmyLeft:20 PullUp:27 ClimbIdle:40 Climb:24 Push:30 PushIdle:40 Grab:40 Pull:30 Punch:10 Punch2:10 Kick:14 SweepKick:18 JumpKick:14 Wave:44 Victory:48 Hurt:20 Slash1:12 Slash2:12 Slash3:18 Slam:24 LeapSlam:28 Spin:12 Cast:16 CastBig:22 CastWeapon:16 CastBigWeapon:22 BowDraw:18 BowRelease:12 Roll:14 Charge:14 Shout:20 HitReact:10 Death:36 Triumph:40","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TULHMDouwvZPF2NbDBStSU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
