: [0, -0.02, 0.18], c: 'wood' }, { box: [0.04, 0.12, 0.5], at: [0, 0.03, 0.62], c: 'metal' }, { box: [0.03, 0.04, 0.2], at: [0, 0.1, 0.9], rot: [0, 0, 0], c: 'metal' }, ...hands([0, -0.04, 0.0], [0.0, -0.4, -0.3]).slice(0, 1)]),\n  m38: G('vm-m38', 'Service revolver', [{ box: [0.06, 0.08, 0.3], at: [0, 0.03, 0.18], c: 'metal' }, piv('Mag', [{ cyl: [0.1, 0.12, 0.1], rot: [90, 0, 0], at: [0, 0.04, 0], c: 'dark', seg: 6 }], [0, 0.03, 0.05]), { box: [0.06, 0.16, 0.08], at: [0, -0.07, -0.02], rot: [20, 0, 0], c: 'wood' }, piv('Bolt', [{ box: [0.03, 0.04, 0.03], at: [0, 0.09, -0.05], c: 'metal' }]), ...rust(0.3, 0.25), ...hands([0, -0.08, -0.04], [0.02, -0.1, -0.02])]),\n  flare: G('vm-flare', 'Flare pistol', [{ box: [0.1, 0.1, 0.34], at: [0, 0.03, 0.18], c: 'accent' }, { box: [0.08, 0.08, 0.12], at: [0, 0.03, 0.4], c: 'metal' }, piv('Mag', [{ box: [0.07, 0.07, 0.1], at: [0, 0, 0], c: 'rust' }], [0, 0.03, 0.12]), { box: [0.06, 0.16, 0.08], at: [0, -0.07, -0.02], rot: [20, 0, 0], c: 'wood' }, piv('Bolt', [{ box: [0.03, 0.04, 0.03], at: [0, 0.09, -0.05], c: 'metal' }]), ...rust(0.34, 0.2), ...hands([0, -0.08, -0.04], [0.02, -0.1, -0.02])]),\n  tractor: G('vm-tractor', 'Tractor rifle', [{ box: [0.07, 0.11, 0.5], at: [0, 0.02, 0.1], c: 'metal' }, { box: [0.045, 0.045, 0.5], at: [0, 0.04, 0.6], c: 'dark' }, { box: [0.07, 0.07, 0.1], at: [0, 0.07, 0.86], c: 'dark' }, { box: [0.07, 0.13, 0.3], at: [0, -0.01, -0.3], c: 'wood' }, { box: [0.06, 0.14, 0.07], at: [0, -0.1, 0.02], rot: [15, 0, 0], c: 'wood' }, piv('Mag', [{ box: [0.06, 0.24, 0.09], at: [0, -0.1, 0.05], rot: [10, 0, 0], c: 'dark' }], [0, -0.08, 0.15]), piv('Bolt', [{ box: [0.04, 0.04, 0.08], at: [0.05, 0.05, 0.0], c: 'metal' }], [0, 0.03, 0.1]), { box: [0.06, 0.04, 0.12], at: [0, 0.1, 0.6], c: 'dark' }, ...rust(0.9, 0.55), ...hands([0, -0.08, -0.04], [0, -0.04, 0.36])]),\n  mule: G('vm-mule', 'Mule pump gun', [{ box: [0.08, 0.1, 0.4], at: [0, 0.02, 0.1], c: 'metal' }, { box: [0.06, 0.06, 0.7], at: [0, 0.04, 0.65], c: '