{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkgiqrYpHdrmvY3Qfbbf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The map, tracker and monocular modules now run headless, so I'm writing the dialogue data for the story layer and then the mission runner.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":443540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"feff64bd-df6d-45b2-b337-83604d3a2d73","uuid":"7f9e8aae-0c25-4dd5-b6d5-7a11ea1d8a60","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:56:43.547Z","request_id":"req_011CgkgiqZw8uSAvzchnwFVv","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkgiqrYpHdrmvY3Qfbbf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014nvL65bACE3WVMVGsFnaTg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162033__x07393c/work/FarPry2*/ && cat > src/content/dialogue.js <<'EOF'\n// Spoken lines, in the plan's voice: weary, exact, short. Sequences are [speaker, text]. Subtitles stay under 60 characters:\n// the player wraps them over two lines. Only characters in the HUD font. Adding a scene needs no code change.\nexport const SEQ = {\n  'm0.bakr': [['bakr', 'Forty miles of track and not one station that remembers its name.'], ['bakr', 'They paint the signs over. Whoever won last.'], ['bakr', 'West Cutting used to be Saint Anne. Before that, Kessel. Before that, a well.'],\n    ['bakr', 'You have the look of a man who read about this place. Reading is a good way to visit.'], ['player', 'Is that the Kettle?'], ['bakr', 'That is the smoke over it. The Kettle is underneath.'],\n    ['bakr', 'Up there they will ask you which side. Say yes.'], ['bakr', 'Mile Forty. Everyone shops here. It is the only honest place, because nobody trusts it.'], ['bakr', 'Raise your map, friend. See where you are. It is the last time it will agree with you.']],\n  'm0.map': [['player', 'MIND THE FEVER. YOU ARE LATE ALREADY. E.H.'], ['player', 'Late for what? I was paid to be on time.']],\n  'm0.fever': [['player', 'The platform tilts. My hands are cold. It is only noon in the mind.'], ['bakr', 'Hey. Hey, friend. Somebody get Sister Odile.']],\n  'm1.wake': [['odile', 'Three tablets. The fourth you pay for. I do not mean in stones.'], ['odile', 'I do not need you to be good. I need you to be on time.'], ['odile', 'Sixty-one beds. Forty blankets. You are the math.'],\n    ['odile', 'The village at Three Wells is out of everything. There is a crate in the truck. Do not stop.'], ['odile', 'Take this rifle. It was somebody\\'s. Press the tablet to your tongue when the shaking starts.']],\n  'm1.go': [['odile', 'Drive west. Past the checkpoint at the dry bed. They are soldiers, so they are bored. That is the danger.']],\n  'm1.deliver': [['player', 'Medicine for Three Wells.'], ['civ', 'Sister Odile sends them. Of course she does. She sends them and counts.'], ['civ', 'Go back by the road. The soldiers there are new.']],\n  'm1.jam': [['player', 'It jams. Of course it jams.'], ['player', 'Slap it. Rack it. Again.']],\n  'm1.stall': [['player', 'The engine is dead. Everything here is on loan.'], ['player', 'Bonnet. Wrench. Hold still.']],\n  'm1.report': [['odile', 'You are three minutes late. I counted.'], ['odile', 'Take the tablets. You owe me a crate of effort.'], ['mags', 'You are the one who fainted on the platform. Sit. This will not hurt. That is a lie.'], ['mags', 'Mags Oyelaran. I was a medic. Now I narrate what I do to people.'], ['mags', 'Come back when you are sick again. I will have kept my opinions.']],\n  'm2.tibor': [['tibor', 'Everything on this rack has been returned at least once.'], ['tibor', 'It fires. If you want it to fire twice, that is a different price.'], ['tibor', 'A woman owes me for a flare pistol. She is in a cage at the Ranger Post. Concord custom.'], ['tibor', 'Bring her out and she will pay you in gratitude. Gratitude is the one thing I do not stock.'], ['tibor', 'Go at night if you can. The Concord sleep badly but they do sleep.']],\n  'm2.cage': [['ines', 'I flew for both of them. Neither paid. Get in.'], ['ines', 'You owe me a truck. You owe me several trucks.'], ['ines', 'Ines Carvalho. I lost my plane to a debt and my debt to a war.'], ['ines', 'If you fall, I will pull you out. Do not make a habit of it.'], ['ines', 'The post is yours now. Sleep there. The beds are only slightly haunted.']],\n  'm2.report': [['tibor', 'She lives. I am almost pleased. Your fee.'], ['tibor', 'There is a man called Dov who drinks at the bar. He asks about sappers. I do not say why.']],\n  'm3.vance': [['vance', 'We do not burn villages. We conclude them.'], ['vance', 'The Harvest keeps a depot at East Siding. Three tanks. It fuels their regrettable trucks.'], ['vance', 'The matter is simple: conclude the tanks. Your invoice will be honoured, regrettably.'],\n    ['vance', 'Take this. A flare pistol. The wind favours us from the north-west this afternoon. Light the grass upwind and it will carry itself.'], ['vance', 'I would be obliged if you did not burn the road. The road is a great sorrow to this office.']],\n  'm3.alt': [['ines', 'Listen. The tanker at post P3. I can get you inside the wire in it. They hold their fire for fuel.'], ['ines', 'Steal the truck. Drive it to the siding. Bail out before it parks. Five stones for the style.']],\n  'm3.done': [['vance', 'The matter is concluded. Smoke is a kind of correspondence.'], ['vance', 'Your invoice will be honoured, regrettably. Fifteen.'], ['vance', 'We will speak again. Mother Ansa will want a word. That is her sorrow, not mine.']],\n  'm3.ansa': [['ansa', 'You said less people. Fewer. Fewer people. It will matter by the end of the month.'], ['ansa', 'The Concord keep a field. A long one. Crop and an ammunition bunker. They think a wall is a harvest.'], ['ansa', 'Burn the field. A hungry man learns to read the wind.'],\n    ['ansa', 'Go at night. The crop is dry and the guards are lazy. Take someone who will come back.']],\n  'm6.go': [['player', 'Tall dry crop. A bunker. A wind from the wrong side.']],\n  'm6.turn': [['player', 'The wind has turned.'], ['buddy', 'Don\\'t let it be the fire. Please. Not the fire.']],\n  'm6.syrette': [['buddy', 'Hold on. Hold. Oh, that is a bad one.'], ['player', 'Syrette.']],\n  'm6.finish': [['player', 'I am sorry.'], ['buddy', 'Do it. Be quick.']],\n  'm6.done': [['ansa', 'You said it was burning. You mean it burned. Tense is a courtesy.'], ['ansa', 'Twenty-five. Count it. Counting is a form of respect.'], ['ansa', 'Some of my pupils were in that field, once, with a hoe. I would prefer you did not tell me.']],\n  'm7.note': [['harrow', 'You have drawn well. Come and see. E.H.']],\n  'm7.go': [['player', 'The truce is gone. Both armies want the Cut. So do I.']],\n  'm7.ledger': [['harrow', 'One contractor, paid in advance, to walk the Kettle. Signed, Emil Harrow.'], ['player', 'He hired me to kill him.'], ['player', 'No. He hired me to burn this place in a line.']],\n  'm7.alt': [['buddy', 'We hold the east road if you go in from the pit side. No pay. Just do not die in my line of sight.']],\n  'm7.done': [['odile', 'Mile Forty is full of smoke and people who thought a truce was a promise.'], ['tibor', 'I am moving my stock into the lockers. Free of charge. This is how I know it is over.'], ['odile', 'Go north. Find the ridge. Harrow wants to see you. I want to know why.']],\n  'm9.climb': [['player', 'Rain on the ridge. No fires tonight. Everything is wet except the guns.']],\n  'm9.scene': [['harrow', 'You are late. I said you would be. Sit down, it won\\'t take long, neither of us has long.'], ['harrow', 'I drew the lines that started this. I would like to draw one more.'], ['harrow', 'You have been drawing for me. Look at it.'],\n    ['harrow', 'Burned grass cannot burn twice. It is the only safe road in the country, and you built it for wages.'], ['harrow', 'A column of people is waiting at the mines. They need a road. You made them one.'],\n    ['harrow', 'This is the only honest map of the minefield at the Pass. I have kept it for this.'], ['harrow', 'Finish your contract, or do not. I have tablets, if you want them. I have never needed a witness before.']],\n  'm9.shot': [['harrow', 'Ah. Accurate. I always liked that in a contractor.']],\n  'm9.spared': [['harrow', 'Thank you. It is a kind of map, too, mercy. Almost no one has surveyed it.']],\n  'end.walk': [['player', 'A case of stones and a map nobody else will ever use.']],\n  'end.give': [['player', 'Here. The sheet. Walk on the ash. It will hold.']],\n  'bar.dov': [['dov', 'Two fingers I left in this country. I came back to see what they are doing.'], ['dov', 'A man asked me to mine his own road, so he would know where it was safe. He was right for a week.'], ['dov', 'I will carry the charges. Two a mission. Do not ask what I do with the third.']],\n  'bar.none': [['player', 'Nobody I know. Nobody who knows me. Good.']],\n  'buddy.rescue.ines': [['ines', 'Get up. Get UP. I am not carrying you twice.']], 'buddy.rescue.dov': [['dov', 'A man fell once and was lifted by a stranger. He said thank you. The stranger said later.']], 'buddy.rescue.mags': [['mags', 'Hold still. No, you can\\'t feel that. No, that\\'s normal. Hold still.']],\n  'buddy.paid': [['mags', 'Not today. Today you owe me money.']],\n  'end.buddies': [['ines', 'We came for the stones. We always do.'], ['dov', 'A man had a case of stones. Three friends. Math is a cruel teacher.'], ['mags', 'I will not shoot you. I want that on record before anyone moves.']],\n};\nexport const BARKS = {\n  concord: { spotted: ['There! In the grass!', 'Contact! Contact!', 'On the ridge! I see him!', 'Stand to! Stand to!'], lost: ['Where did he go?', 'Spread out. Find him.', 'He was just there.'], grenade: ['Grenade! Down!', 'Get clear of that!'],\n    jammed: ['It\\'s stuck! It\\'s stuck again!', 'Not now. Not now.', 'Cover me, it jammed!'], fire: ['Who lit that?', 'Fire! Back off!', 'The wind is bringing it!'], down: ['Man down!', 'Leave him, he\\'s already gone.', 'They got Pavel!'], onfire: ['I am burning! Oh God!', 'Put it out!'], gaveup: ['Nothing. Back to post.', 'Wind, probably.'] },\n  harvest: { spotted: ['Over there! Get him!', 'Brothers, a thief!', 'Mother said watch the field!', 'Eyes! Eyes!'], lost: ['Fewer places to hide than you think.', 'He is gone. Fewer. Fewer men.', 'Keep looking.'], grenade: ['Bomb! Bomb!', 'Move, move!'],\n    jammed: ['It is stuck! Again!', 'Rust. Always rust.', 'Cover me, I am jammed!'], fire: ['Who lit that?', 'Fire! The crop!', 'Turn them back from the grass!'], down: ['He is down!', 'Leave him, he is already gone.', 'A man is dead!'], onfire: ['It burns! It burns!', 'Water! Anyone!'], gaveup: ['It was the wind.', 'Nothing. Go back.'] },\n};\nexport const NPCS = {\n  odile: { name: 'SISTER ODILE', model: 'odile', site: 'mile-forty', at: [-26, -2], clip: 'SmokeIdle' },\n  tibor: { name: 'TIBOR', model: 'tibor', site: 'mile-forty', at: [30, -6], clip: 'Shrug' },\n  bakr: { name: 'OLD BAKR', model: 'bakr', site: 'mile-forty', at: [8, 33], clip: 'Idle' },\n  vance: { name: 'COLONEL VANCE', model: 'vance', site: 'fort-clement', at: [0, 16], clip: 'CleanRifleIdle' },\n  ansa: { name: 'MOTHER ANSA', model: 'ansa', site: 'granary', at: [14, 6], clip: 'TeachPoint' },\n  harrow: { name: 'EMIL HARROW', model: 'harrow', site: 'observatory', at: [3, 4], clip: 'WriteAtDesk' },\n};\nEOF\necho ok"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":443540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"feff64bd-df6d-45b2-b337-83604d3a2d73","uuid":"37451a4a-dd59-483c-92cf-97f926e40433","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:57:15.954Z","request_id":"req_011CgkgiqZw8uSAvzchnwFVv","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_014nvL65bACE3WVMVGsFnaTg":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261105-162033__x07393c/work/FarPry2*/ && cat > src/content/dialogue.js <<'EOF'\n// Spoken lines, in the plan's voice: weary, exact, short. Sequences are [speaker, text]. Subtitles stay under 60 characters:\n// the player wraps them over two lines. Only characters in the HUD font. Adding a scene needs no code change.\nexport const SEQ = {\n  'm0.bakr': [['bakr', 'Forty miles of track and not one station that remembers its name.'], ['bakr', 'They paint the signs over. Whoever won last.'], ['bakr', 'West Cutting used to be Saint Anne. Before that, Kessel. Before that, a well.'],\n    ['bakr', 'You have the look of a man who read about this place. Reading is a good way to visit.'], ['player', 'Is that the Kettle?'], ['bakr', 'That is the smoke over it. The Kettle is underneath.'],\n    ['bakr', 'Up there they will ask you which side. Say yes.'], ['bakr', 'Mile Forty. Everyone shops here. It is the only honest place, because nobody trusts it.'], ['bakr', 'Raise your map, friend. See where you are. It is the last time it will agree with you.']],\n  'm0.map': [['player', 'MIND THE FEVER. YOU ARE LATE ALREADY. E.H.'], ['player', 'Late for what? I was paid to be on time.']],\n  'm0.fever': [['player', 'The platform tilts. My hands are cold. It is only noon in the mind.'], ['bakr', 'Hey. Hey, friend. Somebody get Sister Odile.']],\n  'm1.wake': [['odile', 'Three tablets. The fourth you pay for. I do not mean in stones.'], ['odile', 'I do not need you to be good. I need you to be on time.'], ['odile', 'Sixty-one beds. Forty blankets. You are the math.'],\n    ['odile', 'The village at Three Wells is out of everything. There is a crate in the truck. Do not stop.'], ['odile', 'Take this rifle. It was somebody\\'s. Press the tablet to your tongue when the shaking starts.']],\n  'm1.go': [['odile', 'Drive west. Past the checkpoint at the dry bed. They are soldiers, so they are bored. That is the danger.']],\n  'm1.deliver': [['player', 'Medicine for Three Wells.'], ['civ', 'Sister Odile sends them. Of course she does. She sends them and counts.'], ['civ', 'Go back by the road. The soldiers there are new.']],\n  'm1.jam': [['player', 'It jams. Of course it jams.'], ['player', 'Slap it. Rack it. Again.']],\n  'm1.stall': [['player', 'The engine is dead. Everything here is on loan.'], ['player', 'Bonnet. Wrench. Hold still.']],\n  'm1.report': [['odile', 'You are three minutes late. I counted.'], ['odile', 'Take the tablets. You owe me a crate of effort.'], ['mags', 'You are the one who fainted on the platform. Sit. This will not hurt. That is a lie.'], ['mags', 'Mags Oyelaran. I was a medic. Now I narrate what I do to people.'], ['mags', 'Come back when you are sick again. I will have kept my opinions.']],\n  'm2.tibor': [['tibor', 'Everything on this rack has been returned at least once.'], ['tibor', 'It fires. If you want it to fire twice, that is a different price.'], ['tibor', 'A woman owes me for a flare pistol. She is in a cage at the Ranger Post. Concord custom.'], ['tibor', 'Bring her out and she will pay you in gratitude. Gratitude is the one thing I do not stock.'], ['tibor', 'Go at night if you can. The Concord sleep badly but they do sleep.']],\n  'm2.cage': [['ines', 'I flew for both of them. Neither paid. Get in.'], ['ines', 'You owe me a truck. You owe me several trucks.'], ['ines', 'Ines Carvalho. I lost my plane to a debt and my debt to a war.'], ['ines', 'If you fall, I will pull you out. Do not make a habit of it.'], ['ines', 'The post is yours now. Sleep there. The beds are only slightly haunted.']],\n  'm2.report': [['tibor', 'She lives. I am almost pleased. Your fee.'], ['tibor', 'There is a man called Dov who drinks at the bar. He asks about sappers. I do not say why.']],\n  'm3.vance': [['vance', 'We do not burn villages. We conclude them.'], ['vance', 'The Harvest keeps a depot at East Siding. Three tanks. It fuels their regrettable trucks.'], ['vance', 'The matter is simple: conclude the tanks. Your invoice will be honoured, regrettably.'],\n    ['vance', 'Take this. A flare pistol. The wind favours us from the north-west this afternoon. Light the grass upwind and it will carry itself.'], ['vance', 'I would be obliged if you did not burn the road. The road is a great sorrow to this office.']],\n  'm3.alt': [['ines', 'Listen. The tanker at post P3. I can get you inside the wire in it. They hold their fire for fuel.'], ['ines', 'Steal the truck. Drive it to the siding. Bail out before it parks. Five stones for the style.']],\n  'm3.done': [['vance', 'The matter is concluded. Smoke is a kind of correspondence.'], ['vance', 'Your invoice will be honoured, regrettably. Fifteen.'], ['vance', 'We will speak again. Mother Ansa will want a word. That is her sorrow, not mine.']],\n  'm3.ansa': [['ansa', 'You said less people. Fewer. Fewer people. It will matter by the end of the month.'], ['ansa', 'The Concord keep a field. A long one. Crop and an ammunition bunker. They think a wall is a harvest.'], ['ansa', 'Burn the field. A hungry man learns to read the wind.'],\n    ['ansa', 'Go at night. The crop is dry and the guards are lazy. Take someone who will come back.']],\n  'm6.go': [['player', 'Tall dry crop. A bunker. A wind from the wrong side.']],\n  'm6.turn': [['player', 'The wind has turned.'], ['buddy', 'Don\\'t let it be the fire. Please. Not the fire.']],\n  'm6.syrette': [['buddy', 'Hold on. Hold. Oh, that is a bad one.'], ['player', 'Syrette.']],\n  'm6.finish': [['player', 'I am sorry.'], ['buddy', 'Do it. Be quick.']],\n  'm6.done': [['ansa', 'You said it was burning. You mean it burned. Tense is a courtesy.'], ['ansa', 'Twenty-five. Count it. Counting is a form of respect.'], ['ansa', 'Some of my pupils were in that field, once, with a hoe. I would prefer you did not tell me.']],\n  'm7.note': [['harrow', 'You have drawn well. Come and see. E.H.']],\n  'm7.go': [['player', 'The truce is gone. Both armies want the Cut. So do I.']],\n  'm7.ledger': [['harrow', 'One contractor, paid in advance, to walk the Kettle. Signed, Emil Harrow.'], ['player', 'He hired me to kill him.'], ['player', 'No. He hired me to burn this place in a line.']],\n  'm7.alt': [['buddy', 'We hold the east road if you go in from the pit side. No pay. Just do not die in my line of sight.']],\n  'm7.done': [['odile', 'Mile Forty is full of smoke and people who thought a truce was a promise.'], ['tibor', 'I am moving my stock into the lockers. Free of charge. This is how I know it is over.'], ['odile', 'Go north. Find the ridge. Harrow wants to see you. I want to know why.']],\n  'm9.climb': [['player', 'Rain on the ridge. No fires tonight. Everything is wet except the guns.']],\n  'm9.scene': [['harrow', 'You are late. I said you would be. Sit down, it won\\'t take long, neither of us has long.'], ['harrow', 'I drew the lines that started this. I would like to draw one more.'], ['harrow', 'You have been drawing for me. Look at it.'],\n    ['harrow', 'Burned grass cannot burn twice. It is the only safe road in the country, and you built it for wages.'], ['harrow', 'A column of people is waiting at the mines. They need a road. You made them one.'],\n    ['harrow', 'This is the only honest map of the minefield at the Pass. I have kept it for this.'], ['harrow', 'Finish your contract, or do not. I have tablets, if you want them. I have never needed a witness before.']],\n  'm9.shot': [['harrow', 'Ah. Accurate. I always liked that in a contractor.']],\n  'm9.spared': [['harrow', 'Thank you. It is a kind of map, too, mercy. Almost no one has surveyed it.']],\n  'end.walk': [['player', 'A case of stones and a map nobody else will ever use.']],\n  'end.give': [['player', 'Here. The sheet. Walk on the ash. It will hold.']],\n  'bar.dov': [['dov', 'Two fingers I left in this country. I came back to see what they are doing.'], ['dov', 'A man asked me to mine his own road, so he would know where it was safe. He was right for a week.'], ['dov', 'I will carry the charges. Two a mission. Do not ask what I do with the third.']],\n  'bar.none': [['player', 'Nobody I know. Nobody who knows me. Good.']],\n  'buddy.rescue.ines': [['ines', 'Get up. Get UP. I am not carrying you twice.']], 'buddy.rescue.dov': [['dov', 'A man fell once and was lifted by a stranger. He said thank you. The stranger said later.']], 'buddy.rescue.mags': [['mags', 'Hold still. No, you can\\'t feel that. No, that\\'s normal. Hold still.']],\n  'buddy.paid': [['mags', 'Not today. Today you owe me money.']],\n  'end.buddies': [['ines', 'We came for the stones. We always do.'], ['dov', 'A man had a case of stones. Three friends. Math is a cruel teacher.'], ['mags', 'I will not shoot you. I want that on record before anyone moves.']],\n};\nexport const BARKS = {\n  concord: { spotted: ['There! In the grass!', 'Contact! Contact!', 'On the ridge! I see him!', 'Stand to! Stand to!'], lost: ['Where did he go?', 'Spread out. Find him.', 'He was just there.'], grenade: ['Grenade! Down!', 'Get clear of that!'],\n    jammed: ['It\\'s stuck! It\\'s stuck again!', 'Not now. Not now.', 'Cover me, it jammed!'], fire: ['Who lit that?', 'Fire! Back off!', 'The wind is bringing it!'], down: ['Man down!', 'Leave him, he\\'s already gone.', 'They got Pavel!'], onfire: ['I am burning! Oh God!', 'Put it out!'], gaveup: ['Nothing. Back to post.', 'Wind, probably.'] },\n  harvest: { spotted: ['Over there! Get him!', 'Brothers, a thief!', 'Mother said watch the field!', 'Eyes! Eyes!'], lost: ['Fewer places to hide than you think.', 'He is gone. Fewer. Fewer men.', 'Keep looking.'], grenade: ['Bomb! Bomb!', 'Move, move!'],\n    jammed: ['It is stuck! Again!', 'Rust. Always rust.', 'Cover me, I am jammed!'], fire: ['Who lit that?', 'Fire! The crop!', 'Turn them back from the grass!'], down: ['He is down!', 'Leave him, he is already gone.', 'A man is dead!'], onfire: ['It burns! It burns!', 'Water! Anyone!'], gaveup: ['It was the wind.', 'Nothing. Go back.'] },\n};\nexport const NPCS = {\n  odile: { name: 'SISTER ODILE', model: 'odile', site: 'mile-forty', at: [-26, -2], clip: 'SmokeIdle' },\n  tibor: { name: 'TIBOR', model: 'tibor', site: 'mile-forty', at: [30, -6], clip: 'Shrug' },\n  bakr: { name: 'OLD BAKR', model: 'bakr', site: 'mile-forty', at: [8, 33], clip: 'Idle' },\n  vance: { name: 'COLONEL VANCE', model: 'vance', site: 'fort-clement', at: [0, 16], clip: 'CleanRifleIdle' },\n  ansa: { name: 'MOTHER ANSA', model: 'ansa', site: 'granary', at: [14, 6], clip: 'TeachPoint' },\n  harrow: { name: 'EMIL HARROW', model: 'harrow', site: 'observatory', at: [3, 4], clip: 'WriteAtDesk' },\n};\nEOF\necho ok"}}}
